# Brand Design System — Netso Energy / Aesthetic Baseline

Use this file as the canonical style anchor for all AI-generated work.
Goal: recognizable consistency across social, product, brand, and web assets.

## Voice
- Executive, technical, clean, confident, no hype.
- Solar + commercial + Bangladeshi market context.
- Keywords to weave in naturally: clean energy, C&I solar, PPA, IDCOL, DSCR, BDT, kilowatt, rooftop, commissioning.

## Color
- Primary: deep navy `#0B1D2E`
- Accent: solar amber `#F5A623`
- Surface: cool gray `#F3F4F6`
- Text: near-black `#111827`

## Typography feel
- Sans, geometric, high legibility, tight tracking on headlines.
- Generous whitespace, right-aligned labels, left-aligned body.

## Image style
- Pricing: cinematic studio lighting, softboxes, minimal shadows.
- Editorial: news/magazine style, clean desk, MacBook/print collateral optional.
- Product: 45-degree elevated, matte finishes, concrete or soft-gray surface, slim depth of field.

## Composition
- Negative space rule: at least 40% breathing room for copy overlay.
- Rule of thirds for product placement.
- Brand mark always top-left or bottom-right, never center.

## Format rules by channel
- Instagram carousel: 4:5 portrait, 1080x1350
- Instagram square: 1:1
- LinkedIn feed: 1:1 or 16:9
- LinkedIn cover: 4:1 banner
- X/Twitter: 16:9
- TikTok: 9:16
